<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_ui",
    "What the channel you are reading is keeping — newest first. A channel keeps up to 50 lines; everything else scrolls away as usual."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_btn_set_topic}>{dgettext("help_ui", "Opening it")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_ui",
    "A Pinned button appears in the conversation toolbar, with the count beside it, and only while the channel is keeping something. An empty window is not worth a button."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_channels}>{dgettext("help_ui", "What a row does")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_ui",
    "Pressing a row scrolls the conversation to the line it kept, where the message sits in its original place with everything around it. Operators also get an Unpin beside each row."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_pin}>{dgettext("help_ui", "When it helps")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_ui",
    "Use it for things people keep asking about: the channel rules, an important link, or a decision the room made. Newcomers can find them without scrolling back."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_btn_set_topic}>{dgettext("help_ui", "How to pin a message")}</.help_h4>
<ol>
  <li>{dgettext("help_ui", "Right-click the message in the channel.")}</li>
  <li>{dgettext("help_ui", "Choose Pin. The Pinned button appears or its count goes up.")}</li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_ui",
      "To remove it, right-click the message and choose Unpin, or press Unpin beside its row in this window."
    )}
  </li>
</ol>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_ui",
    "You can also type %{pin} or %{unpin} followed by the message id.",
    pin: "/pin",
    unpin: "/unpin"
  )}
</p>
<pre>/pin 1284
/unpin 1284</pre>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_rules}>{dgettext("help_ui", "Rules and limits")}</.help_h4>
<ul>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_ui",
      "Only the channel owner and operators can pin or unpin. Other members do not see these menu items."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_ui",
      "A pin belongs to the channel. Everyone in the channel sees the same list."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_ui",
      "When a channel already keeps 50 messages, you must unpin one before you can pin another."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>{dgettext("help_ui", "Pins exist only in channels, not in private conversations.")}</li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_ui",
      "Each row shows who wrote the message, when, a short preview, and who pinned it. More rows load as you scroll down."
    )}
  </li>
</ul>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_link}>{dgettext("help_ui", "See Also")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  <.help_link topic="cmd-pin">{dgettext("help_ui", "/pin")}</.help_link>
  | <.help_link topic="cmd-unpin">{dgettext("help_ui", "/unpin")}</.help_link>
  |
  <.help_link topic="feature-saved-messages">{dgettext("help_ui", "Saved Messages")}</.help_link>
  | <.help_link topic="ui-context-menu">{dgettext("help_ui", "Context Menu")}</.help_link>
</p>
